{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":34995146,"ns":0,"title":"Dieudonné plank","extract":"In mathematics, the Dieudonné plank is a specific topological space introduced by Dieudonné (1944). It is an example of a metacompact space that is not paracompact.","description":"Example of a metacompact topological space that is not paracompact","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}